    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert AI Recruitment Assistant.\n\nCompare the following Resume and Job Description.\n\nResume:\n{{ $json.resume_text }}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $json.jd_text }}\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Compare the resume with the job description.\n2. Calculate a match score between 0 and 100.\n3. List all matched skills.\n4. List missing skills.\n5. Identify candidate strengths.\n6. Identify candidate weaknesses.\n7. Give one recommendation using only one of these values:\n   - Highly Recommended\n   - Recommended\n   - Consider\n   - Not Recommended\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"match_score\": 0,\n  \"matched_skills\": [],\n  \"missing_skills\": [],\n  \"strengths\": [],\n  \"weaknesses\": [],\n  \"recommendation\": \"\"\n}                                             Return the response using the connected Structured Output Parser.    ",
